---
source: src/highlighting/highlighter.rs
expression: "cfg.highlight(\"nocorrect VAR=value sh -c 'echo $VAR'\")?"
---
nocorrect VAR=value sh -c 'echo $VAR'

0   9   `nocorrect`  keyword.control.flow.nocorrect
10  13  `VAR`        variable.other.readwrite.assignment
13  14  `=`          keyword.operator.assignment
14  19  `value`      string.unquoted
20  22  `sh`         CALLABLE `sh`
22  24  ` -`         punctuation.definition.parameter
24  25  `c`          variable.parameter.option
25  26  ` `          meta.function-call.arguments
26  27  `'`          punctuation.definition.string.begin
27  36  `echo $VAR`  string.quoted.single
36  37  `'`          punctuation.definition.string.end
